{
  "uid": "kentik-home",
  "title": "Kentik: Overview",
  "tags": [
    "kentik"
  ],
  "timezone": "",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Kentik datasource",
        "query": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Welcome to Kentik for Grafana (v3)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Kentik network observability \u2014 now backend-powered\n\nThis datasource queries the **Kentik Universal Data Explorer (UDE)** APIs from a Go backend, which unlocks:\n\n- **Grafana Alerting & recorded queries** \u2014 server-side execution against Kentik\n- **Template variables from the Kentik dictionary** \u2014 e.g. `measurements()`, `metrics(/traffic)`, `dimensions(/traffic)`, `dimension_values(/traffic, dst_geo)`\n- **Ad-hoc filters** sourced from Kentik dimensions\n- **\"Open in Kentik\"** data links on every series (click a point \u2192 jump to Data Explorer)\n- **Geo visualizations** using Kentik geo dimensions (see the *Global Traffic Map* dashboard)\n\nUse the **Kentik datasource** picker above to point these panels at your Kentik connection."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total Throughput",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "green" },
              { "value": 1000000000, "color": "yellow" },
              { "value": 10000000000, "color": "red" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "kentik-connect-datasource", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "queryType": "ude",
          "measurement": "/traffic",
          "metrics": ["both_bits_per_sec"],
          "dimensions": [],
          "filterGroups": [],
          "filterConnector": "All",
          "vizType": 3,
          "limit": 1,
          "rollups": [{ "metric": "both_bits_per_sec", "fn": "avg" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ingress",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "kentik-connect-datasource", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "queryType": "ude",
          "measurement": "/traffic",
          "metrics": ["in_bits_per_sec"],
          "dimensions": [],
          "filterGroups": [],
          "filterConnector": "All",
          "vizType": 3,
          "limit": 1,
          "rollups": [{ "metric": "in_bits_per_sec", "fn": "avg" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Egress",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "kentik-connect-datasource", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "queryType": "ude",
          "measurement": "/traffic",
          "metrics": ["out_bits_per_sec"],
          "dimensions": [],
          "filterGroups": [],
          "filterConnector": "All",
          "vizType": 3,
          "limit": 1,
          "rollups": [{ "metric": "out_bits_per_sec", "fn": "avg" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Traffic by Site",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bps",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineWidth": 1
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "kentik-connect-datasource", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "queryType": "ude",
          "measurement": "/traffic",
          "metrics": ["both_bits_per_sec"],
          "dimensions": ["i_device_site_name"],
          "filterGroups": [],
          "filterConnector": "All",
          "vizType": 1,
          "limit": 10,
          "aliasBy": "{{i_device_site_name}}",
          "rollups": [{ "metric": "both_bits_per_sec", "fn": "avg" }]
        }
      ]
    },
